  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett samarbete med lokala organisationer i omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r    kvinnor Economic Empowerment ( WEE ) , kampen mot HTPS , FGM , GBV ,  och oj&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet . Det utf&#xf6;rs genom paraply modalitythrough 20 under stipendiater av MCMDO . Under stipendiaterna genomf&#xf6;ra projektet p&#xe5;   gr&#xe4;srotsniv&#xe5;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is collaboration with local CSOs in the area of women     economic empowerment (WEE), fight against HTPs, FGM,GBV, and Gender   Inequality. It is executed through umbrella modalitythrough 20        sub-grantees of MCMDO. The Sub-grantees implement the project at      grassroots level.</narrative>
